    silm:hasLongDescription "The AnnualBillCoconeArrow is the per-entity component of the AnnualBill77 cocone: alpha_Mittens lists Mittens's vet visits, alpha_Pumpkin lists Pumpkin's, alpha_Vet77 lists the vet's authored invoices, alpha_Household resolves the billing address." .

