    silm:hasLongDescription "The AnnualBillMediator is the unique mediator HouseholdKG -> AnnualBill77 promised by the universal property; the encyclopedia's formal warrant for \"one annual bill for the whole household\". In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

